# Arch block 0: a wooden half-arch block of natural beech (toy_beech), 2.4 m long, 1.2 m deep and 1.05 m tall (60 times life size), lying on its long side with its
# round tunnel through the depth. Knee cover: jump on it; convex collider (the tunnel is not walked through).
format 1

# A fifth of the vertices its size would give it: a plain block with one tunnel
Detail detail=0.75
    Material material=toy_beech
        Subtraction
            Translate translation=(0, 0.525, 0)
                RoundBox size=(1.2, 0.525, 0.6) roundness=0.05
            # The tunnel
            ArbitraryCappedCylinder a=(0, 0, -1) b=(0, 0, 1) radius=0.62
